IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SENSOR-MONITOR.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SENSOR-DATA ASSIGN TO "harness_pipe".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  SENSOR-DATA.
01  SENSOR-REC        PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-STATUS         PIC X(20).
01  WS-VALUE          PIC 9(5)V99.
01  WS-DISPLAY        PIC ZZZ9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- STARTING SENSOR MONITOR ---"
    OPEN INPUT SENSOR-DATA.
    
    IF WS-STATUS = "ERROR"
        DISPLAY "FATAL: CANNOT OPEN DEVICE"
        STOP RUN.

    PERFORM 100-PROCESS-DATA UNTIL WS-STATUS = "END".
    
    CLOSE SENSOR-DATA.
    DISPLAY "--- MONITORING SESSION CLOSED ---"
    STOP RUN.

100-PROCESS-DATA.
    READ SENSOR-DATA
        AT END
            MOVE "END" TO WS-STATUS
        NOT AT END
            MOVE SENSOR-REC TO WS-VALUE
            MOVE WS-VALUE TO WS-DISPLAY
            DISPLAY "CURRENT READING: " WS-DISPLAY
    END-READ.